"question": "The formula expressing the relationship between \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) in the table is:\n\n\\[\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline x & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 & 6\\\\ \\hline y & 0 & 2 & 6 & 12 & 20\\\\ \\hline\\end{array}\\]",
"questionType": "text",
"choices": {
"A": "\\(y=2x-4\\)",
"B": "\\(y=x^2-3x+2\\)",
"C": "\\(y=x^3-3x^2+2x\\)",
"D": "\\(y=x^2-4x\\)",
"E": "\\(y=x^2-4\\)"
},
"choiceOrder": [
"A",
"B",
"C",
"D",
"E"
],
"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "B",
