"explanation": "The percentage saved compares the saving with the original price. Since she paid \\(\\$25\\) after saving \\(\\$2.50\\), the original price was \\(\\$27.50\\). Thus the percentage saved was\n\\[\n\\frac{2.50}{27.50}\\cdot100\\%\n=\\frac1{11}\\cdot100\\%\n\\approx9.09\\%.\n\\]\nThis is about \\(9\\%\\), choice B.",
