"responseType": "choice",
"question": "\\(ABCD\\) is a square with side of unit length. Points \\(E\\) and \\(F\\) are taken respectively on sides \\(AB\\) and \\(AD\\) so that \\(AE=AF\\) and the quadrilateral \\(CDFE\\) has maximum area. In square units this maximum area is:",
