"label": "Translate along opposite sides",
"explanation": "Opposite sides of a parallelogram have the same length and direction when followed from \\(P\\) to \\(Q\\) and from \\(S\\) to \\(R\\). From \\(P(-3,-2)\\) to \\(Q(1,-5)\\), we move \\(4\\) units right and \\(3\\) units down.\n\nReversing that movement from \\(R\\) gives\n\\[\nS=(9-4,\\,1+3)=(5,4).\n\\]\nThe requested sum is \\(5+4=9\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
