"question": "Let\n\n\\[ \\begin{aligned} f(n) &=\\frac{5+3\\sqrt5}{10} \\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)^n\\\\ &\\quad+\\frac{5-3\\sqrt5}{10} \\left(\\frac{1-\\sqrt5}{2}\\right)^n. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThen \\(f(n+1)-f(n-1),\\) expressed in terms of \\(f(n),\\) equals:",
