"question": "If \\(n\\) is a multiple of \\(4,\\) the sum\n\n\\[ \\begin{aligned} s&=1+2i+3i^2+\\cdots\\\\ &\\quad+(n+1)i^n, \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nwhere \\(i=\\sqrt{-1},\\) equals:",
