"question": "How many distinct ordered triples \\((x,y,z)\\) satisfy the equations \\[ \\begin{aligned} x+2y+4z&=12,\\\\ xy+4yz+2xz&=22,\\\\ xyz&=6? \\end{aligned} \\]",
"questionType": "text",
