"explanation": "Each of \\(a,b,c,d\\) appears positively in three parentheses and negatively in one. Thus each has total coefficient \\(3-1=2\\). The expression simplifies to\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n2(a+b+c+d)\n&=2(1+10+100+1000)\\\\\n&=2(1111)=2222.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(2222\\), choice B.",
