"explanation": "The numerator \\(10^7\\) contains seven factors of \\(10\\), while \\(10^4\\) in the denominator contains four. Canceling those four nonzero factors leaves three factors of \\(10\\) in the numerator:\n\\[\n\\frac{10^7}{5\\times10^4}\n=\\frac{10\\times10\\times10}{5}\n=\\frac{1000}{5}\n=200.\n\\]\nThe value is \\(200\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
