"explanation": "For this estimate, use the same thickness per sheet throughout the stack. Then the number of sheets is proportional to the stack's height. A \\(1\\)-cm stack contains approximately\n\\[\n500\\div5=100\\text{ sheets}.\n\\]\nTherefore a \\(7.5\\)-cm stack contains approximately \\(7.5\\times100=750\\) sheets, choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
