"label": "Balance around 85",
"explanation": "Use \\(85\\), the final average, as the target score for each test. Since the first six average \\(84\\), their total is\n\\[\n6(85-84)=6\n\\]\npoints below the total of six scores of \\(85\\). To make all seven tests average \\(85\\), the seventh score must supply those missing \\(6\\) points in addition to its own \\(85\\). Thus it is \\(85+6=\\boxed{91}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{D}}\\).",
