"solution": "A rectangle's area is its length times its width. The labeled sides are \\(0.4\\) meter and \\(0.22\\) meter, so\n\\[\nA=0.4\\times0.22=0.088\\text{ m}^2.\n\\]\nFor the decimal multiplication, \\(4\\times22=88\\), and the factors have three decimal places altogether, giving \\(0.088\\). The area is \\(\\boxed{0.088\\text{ m}^2}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{A}}\\).",
