"explanation": "Because Joe's first statement is false, Carl is not next to Bret. Bret occupies seat \\(3\\), whose adjacent seats are \\(2\\) and \\(4\\). Carl therefore cannot occupy either of those seats, and seat \\(3\\) is already taken. Thus Carl must occupy seat \\(1\\).\n\nOnly seats \\(2\\) and \\(4\\) remain for Abby and Dana. Seat \\(2\\) is between Carl in seat \\(1\\) and Bret in seat \\(3\\). Since Joe's second statement is also false, Abby cannot occupy seat \\(2\\), so she must occupy seat \\(4\\).\n\nDana must therefore occupy seat \\(2\\), choice D.",
