"explanation": "For each triangle, add the top and lower-left entries, then subtract the lower-right entry. Thus the first triangle has value\n\\[\n1+3-4=0,\n\\]\nand the second has value\n\\[\n2+5-6=1.\n\\]\nTheir indicated sum is \\(0+1=\\boxed{1}\\), choice \\(\\text{D}\\).",
