"explanation": "Of the \\(40\\) students from Jones, \\(20\\) are girls, so Jones has\n\\[\n40-20=20\\text{ boys}.\n\\]\nAll \\(52\\) boys are from either Jones or Clay. Removing the Jones boys leaves\n\\[\n52-20=\\boxed{32}\n\\]\nboys from Clay, choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{B}}\\).",
