"label": "Count the whole family",
"explanation": "Harry is one of the boys, so the family has \\(5+1=6\\) boys and \\(3\\) girls. Harriet is one of those three girls, so her sisters are the other \\(3-1=2\\) girls. Thus \\(S=2\\).\n\nAll six boys are Harriet's brothers, so \\(B=6\\). Therefore\n\\[\nSB=2\\times6=12.\n\\]\nThe product is \\(12\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
