"label": "Track the percentage remaining",
"explanation": "A price \\(30\\%\\) below retail is \\(100\\%-30\\%=70\\%\\) of retail. Alice then pays half of that marked price, so she pays\n\\[\n\\frac12\\cdot70\\%=35\\%\n\\]\nof the suggested retail price. The answer is \\(35\\%\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
