"explanation": "To find who has the least money, we can compare each person with Moe. The clues directly say that Bo, Coe, and Jo each have more money than Moe. Flo has more money than Bo, who has more than Moe, so Flo also has more than Moe.\n\nEvery other person therefore has more money than Moe. The answer is Moe, choice \\(\\text{E}\\).",
