"solution": "First find how many full recipes are needed, because the butter must cover those complete recipes. Fourteen pans make \\(14\\cdot15=210\\) cookies, which is too few. Fifteen pans make \\(225\\) cookies, so they need \\(15\\) recipes.\n\nEach recipe uses \\(3\\) tablespoons of butter, giving a total of\n\\[\n15\\cdot3=45\\text{ tablespoons}.\n\\]\nFive sticks supply only \\(5\\cdot8=40\\) tablespoons, while six supply \\(6\\cdot8=48\\). Therefore they need \\(\\boxed{6}\\) sticks of butter, choice \\(\\text{B}\\).",
