"explanation": "We can follow the sum without knowing the individual numbers. Adding \\(3\\) to each of two numbers adds \\(3+3=6\\) to their sum, making it \\(S+6\\). Doubling each resulting number doubles their sum, so the final sum is\n\\[\n2(S+6)=2S+12.\n\\]\nThus the answer is \\(\\boxed{2S+12}\\), choice E.",
