"explanation": "Equal spacing suggests counting the gaps between trees. From the first tree to the fourth there are \\(3\\) gaps, so each gap measures\n\\[\n60\\div3=20\\text{ feet}.\n\\]\nFrom the first tree to the sixth and last tree there are \\(5\\) gaps. Thus the distance is\n\\[\n5\\times20=100\\text{ feet},\n\\]\nchoice B.",
