"label": "Substitute and follow the operation order",
"explanation": "When \\(x=4\\), we have \\(3x-2=10\\), \\(4x=16\\), and \\(4x+1=17\\). Substitute these values and perform the multiplications before the subtraction and addition:\n\\[\n10\\cdot17-10\\cdot16+1\n=170-160+1=11.\n\\]\nThe value is \\(\\boxed{11}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
