"label": "Remove complete weeks",
"explanation": "Carlos is zero days old on his birthday, a Saturday. Every seven days brings the same weekday again. Since\n\\[\n706=7\\cdot100+6,\n\\]\nhe will be \\(706\\) days old after \\(100\\) complete weeks and six additional days. The complete weeks bring him to Saturday, and six more days bring him to Friday. The answer is \\(\\boxed{\\text{Friday, choice C}}\\).",
