"explanation": "First convert Lisa's percentage goal into a number of quizzes. She needs at least\n\\[\n0.80\\cdot50=40\n\\]\nA grades. Since she already has \\(22\\), she needs at least \\(40-22=18\\) more. There are \\(50-30=20\\) quizzes remaining, so at most\n\\[\n20-18=\\boxed{2}\n\\]\ncan receive grades below A. Earning \\(18\\) A grades and \\(2\\) lower grades would give exactly \\(40\\) A grades, so this maximum is attainable. The answer is choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
