"question": "2006 AMC 8 scoring rule: The score is the number of correct answers.\n\nOn the AMC \\(8\\) contest Billy answers \\(13\\) questions correctly, answers \\(7\\) questions incorrectly and doesn’t answer the last \\(5.\\) What is his score?",
