"label": "Add the wall areas",
"explanation": "Each bedroom has two walls measuring \\(12\\) feet by \\(8\\) feet and two measuring \\(10\\) feet by \\(8\\) feet. Their total area is\n\\[\n2(12\\cdot8)+2(10\\cdot8)=352\n\\]\nsquare feet. Subtract the \\(60\\) square feet occupied by doorways and windows to get \\(352-60=292\\) square feet to paint per bedroom. For all three bedrooms, the required area is\n\\[\n3\\cdot292=\\boxed{876}\n\\]\nsquare feet, choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
