"label": "Apply the operation in each order",
"explanation": "In the definition, the multiplier is the second input, so evaluate each ordered pair separately:\n\\[\n3\\star5=(3+5)5=40,\n\\qquad\n5\\star3=(5+3)3=24.\n\\]\nTherefore\n\\[\n(3\\star5)-(5\\star3)=40-24=\\boxed{16},\n\\]\nchoice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
