"explanation": "The spaghetti bar reaches \\(250\\), and the manicotti bar reaches \\(100\\). Since the question asks for spaghetti to manicotti, put the spaghetti count first:\n\\[\n\\frac{250}{100}=\\frac{250\\div 50}{100\\div 50}=\\frac{5}{2}.\n\\]\nThe ratio is \\(\\dfrac{5}{2}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\).",
