"label": "Count the backward steps",
"explanation": "Counting backward from \\(201\\), we take \\(201-53=148\\) steps to reach \\(53\\). Since \\(201\\) itself is the first number counted, the position is one greater than the number of steps. Thus\n\\[\nn=148+1=149,\n\\]\nwhich is choice D.",
