"explanation": "The seven extra payments together cover Judi's entire original share. Therefore her share was\n\\[\n7\\cdot\\$2.50=\\$17.50.\n\\]\nThe bill was originally divided into eight equal shares, including Judi's. Its total was therefore\n\\[\n8\\cdot\\$17.50=\\$140.\n\\]\nThe total bill was \\(\\$140\\), choice C.",
