"label": "Apply the formula and compare with 2",
"explanation": "Using the given formula, the harmonic mean is\n\\[\nH=\\frac{2\\cdot1\\cdot2016}{1+2016}\n=\\frac{4032}{2017}.\n\\]\nTwice the denominator is \\(4034\\), so rewriting the fraction shows exactly how close it is to \\(2\\):\n\\[\nH=2-\\frac2{2017}.\n\\]\nBecause \\(0<2/2017<1/2\\), we have \\(3/2<H<2\\). Thus the closest integer is \\(\\boxed{2}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{A}\\).",
