"question": "The faces of each of \\(7\\) standard dice are labeled with the integers from \\(1\\) to \\(6.\\) Let \\(p\\) be the probability that when all \\(7\\) dice are rolled, the sum of the numbers on the top faces is \\(10.\\) What other sum occurs with the same probability \\(p?\\)",
