"label": "Divide the filled fraction equally among five cups",
"explanation": "The juice occupies \\(\\frac34\\) of the pitcher's total capacity. Sharing that juice equally among \\(5\\) cups gives each cup\n\n\\[\n\\frac34\\div5=\\frac3{20}=\\frac{15}{100}\n\\]\n\nof the pitcher's capacity. That is \\(\\boxed{15\\%}\\), choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\). The reference whole remains the full pitcher, even though the pitcher was only partly filled.",
