"explanation": "Simplify the difference before squaring: \\(2112-2021=91=7\\cdot13\\), while \\(169=13^2\\). Thus\n\\[\n\\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}=\\frac{(7\\cdot13)^2}{13^2}=7^2=49.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{49}\\), choice C.",
