"explanation": "Constant speed means the number of laps is proportional to the time. Mike completes \\(15/57\\) laps per minute, so in \\(27\\) minutes he completes\n\\[\n27\\cdot\\frac{15}{57}=\\frac{135}{19}=7\\frac2{19}\n\\]\nlaps. This is approximately \\(\\boxed{7}\\), choice B.",
