"question": "The sum\n\n\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{k^3 + 6k^2 + 8k}\\]\n\ncan be expressed as \\(\\dfrac{a}{b},\\) where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are relatively prime positive integers. What is \\(a + b?\\)",
